{
  "id": "2034:44493",
  "name": "START HERE — Continuation review guide",
  "text": [
    {
      "id": "2034:44494",
      "text": "Potluck + Splitfinder\nComplete the journey"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44495",
      "text": "CONTINUATION · OCTOBER 02 · REVIEW BUILD"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44496",
      "text": "This section completes missing steps around the existing screens. The original designs and their components remain unchanged. Branded screens are on the left; matching generic-icon variants are to their right."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44497",
      "text": "Try a journey"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44499",
      "text": "01 · Guest discovery → account → introduction  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44500",
      "text": "Browse first. Registration starts only when you pursue a listing."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44503",
      "text": "02 · Generic-icon discovery  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44504",
      "text": "Same layouts and copy; native Potluck category icons replace logos."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44507",
      "text": "03 · Host a listing  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44508",
      "text": "Choose a service, set the arrangement, preview and publish."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44511",
      "text": "04 · Hosting: incoming requests  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44512",
      "text": "Joseph is the host; Alex is the interested applicant."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44515",
      "text": "05 · Applicant: accepted response  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44516",
      "text": "Joseph receives Maya’s acceptance. It opens a conversation."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44519",
      "text": "06 · Applicant: declined / unavailable  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44520",
      "text": "Review the alternative outcome and continue browsing."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44523",
      "text": "07 · Phone-plan discovery  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44524",
      "text": "Provider directory, individual listings, introduction and publication."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44527",
      "text": "08 · Membership introduction  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44528",
      "text": "A member-created service with explicit eligibility."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44531",
      "text": "09 · Housing continuation  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44532",
      "text": "Existing housing design, contextual registration and verification states."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44535",
      "text": "10 · Circle host administration  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44536",
      "text": "Joseph manages people, invitations, handover and leaving."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44539",
      "text": "11 · Alex receives a Circle invitation  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44540",
      "text": "Recipient view. Joining a Circle does not accept financial terms."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44543",
      "text": "12 · Jordan receives a host handover  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44544",
      "text": "Recipient view of the proposed Circle Host role."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44547",
      "text": "13 · Maya receives a host handover  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44548",
      "text": "Recipient view of the proposed Circle Host role."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44551",
      "text": "14 · Account recovery  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44552",
      "text": "Reset-link delivery, expired-link and updated-password states."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44555",
      "text": "15 · Connection failure  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44556",
      "text": "Retry without losing the sign-in destination."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44559",
      "text": "16 · Publication failed  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44560",
      "text": "A saved draft with a clear retry action."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44563",
      "text": "17 · Message not sent  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44564",
      "text": "Retry or edit your unsent message."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44567",
      "text": "18 · Housing ID check: complete  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44568",
      "text": "External verification callback represented as a design state."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44571",
      "text": "19 · Housing ID check: retry  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44572",
      "text": "Recover without losing the property draft."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44575",
      "text": "20 · Phone request accepted  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44576",
      "text": "Jordan responds; continue the conversation."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44579",
      "text": "21 · Membership request accepted  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44580",
      "text": "Casey responds; continue the conversation."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44583",
      "text": "22 · Account and safety  →"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44584",
      "text": "Profile, support, reporting, blocking and deletion states."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44586",
      "text": "What this prototype demonstrates"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44587",
      "text": "Editable Figma screens, reusable components, selection states, navigation, consent checks and recovery outcomes. Forms use illustrative example content. Email, provider sign-in, identity verification, notifications and incoming responses are simulated states—not connected services. Listing names, prices, dates and availability are fixtures."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44588",
      "text": "Content still needed before launch"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44589",
      "text": "Approved application Terms and Privacy copy. Their unavailable/loading outcomes are designed here; website-only legal copy was not substituted. The existing Sharing Rules are linked where relevant."
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44590",
      "text": "Remove this continuation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2034:44591",
      "text": "Delete this Screens section and “CONTINUATION — Potluck & Splitfinder — Components — Oct 02” on 02 Components. Remove the separate “CONTINUATION / Prototype state / Oct 02” variable collection. Original screens do not depend on these additions."
    }
  ],
